# Every text file is checked out with LF on every system. Windows' git
# defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which gave a Windows checkout CRLF in the
# templates, skills and docs that go:embed bakes into lore (a lore built
# there wrote CRLF workflow files and its docs drift test failed), and in
# the golden files the tests compare byte for byte. Go and gofmt use LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.woff2 binary

# >>> lore-sync >>>
.lore/data/**/*.json text eol=lf merge=lore linguist-generated=true
.lore/data/*.json text eol=lf merge=lore linguist-generated=true
.lore/LORE.md text eol=lf merge=lore-keep-ours linguist-generated=true
